<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Seattle NeighborLink Map</name>
    <description><![CDATA[As of May 2017, we have updated the Seattle Emergency Hubs NeighborLink Map to include the Seattle P-Patch Gardens as designated Hub locations in the event of an Emergency.  <br>A solid hub icon indicates a hub that is networked and practices, an open hub icon is a place to gather. <br>Also, we have added "Map Your Neighborhood - MYN" and "SNAP" Groups to the Neighborlink map including their community emergency contacts.<br><br>Block Watch Captains are encouraged to add their Group information as well!  Let's stay connected and safe.]]></description>
