        <name>Magnolia Village Emergency Hub </name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: An active hub that will set up for exercises and after an emergency. <br><br><br>Hub Location: 33rd Ave. West and West Smith St  , South Playfield, Southwest corner<br>Hub Captain: Bill Fay<br>Email: bfay2191@gmail.com <br>Phone: 206-323-0566 <br>Website: http://magnoliaemergencyhub.com<br>X Coordinate: -122.3985955<br>Y Coordinate: 47.6418527<br>CERT Members: Bill Fay (bfay2191@gmail.com)<br>CERT Members 2: Daniel Stordahl (W7YLK@outlook.com)]]></description>
