      <Placemark>
        <name>Central West ACS Sector</name>
        <description><![CDATA[description: Hub Location: <br>Hub Captain: <br>Email: <br>Phone: <br>Website: <br>X Coordinate: <br>Y Coordinate: <br>description: An ACS Sector is one of 7 geographic areas in Seattle where amateur radio operators are positioned to provide emergency communications between the community and the Seattle Emergency Operations Center. If you would like to learn more about the Seattle Auxiliary Communications Service, visit our website www.seattleACS.org or email seattleacs1@gmail.com.<br><br>CERT Members: <br>CERT Members 2:<br>Hub Location: <br>Hub Captain: <br>Email: <br>Phone: <br>Website: <br>X Coordinate: <br>Y Coordinate: <br>CERT Members: <br>CERT Members 2: ]]></description>
